// `::` is not a path separator in Astra. The seed's `parse_use` used to match
// it even though the construct grammar (constructs/use.c) and research/010
// §12.1 declare `ImportPath ::= Identifier ("." Identifier)*`, so `use a::b`
// compiled here and nowhere else. Phase 2.2 adopted the dot form and fixed the
// seed; this case pins the decision so the drift cannot come back.
// EXPECT-ERROR: unexpected token in expression
use a::b
